{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "102", "sample_idx": 45, "model_name": "mistralai/ministral-14b-instruct-2512", "content": "* ---\n  **Lady in Ball Gown (adjusting her gloves):** \"Good grief, darling—you’re actually going out in *those*? Can’t say I blame you, but I swear, the heat in here is suffocating enough without looking like you raided your brother’s gym bag. Here, let me fan you with this napkin—you’re turning a frightful shade of *sweaty crimson*.\"\n\n  **Person in Sweats (scratching their arm):** \"Oh, spare me the *high society gasp*—I’d trade all your sequins for one less layer. You’d think we were heading to a *royal coronation* instead of a charity auction at the community center. At least my hoodie’s got pockets. Need anything? Extra deodorant? A spare shirt to bail you out of this gown’s neckline?\"\n\n---\n\n* ---\n  **Lady in Ball Gown (sipping champagne from a plastic cup):** \"Charity auction, indeed. I don’t know how you stand it. I’ve ironed these lace sleeves *three times* already, and you’ve got *chips* in your sweatpants. Honestly, if we’re being judged, I’d rather face the Queen in this than you in yesterday’s hoodie. Though, I’ll admit, your sneakers *do* go surprisingly well with my heels—like a rebellious little jazz solo in an orchestra of pearls.\"\n\n  **Person in Sweats (grinning, holding open the car door):** \"And yet, here you are, *still* stranded with me. I mean, sure, I’ll play your chauffeur tonight, but only because I *know* you’d rather walk in those heels than admit you can’t reach the brake pedal. Also, if we *do* get stopped by security, I’m telling them you’re my *very* wealthy cousin. Works every time.\"\n\n---\n\n* ---\n  **Lady in Ball Gown (yelling over loud music at the event):** \"I can’t hear you over the *disaster* that is your taste in music! This is a *classy* event! Or it was, until DJ Sweatshop took over. Why are you clapping along? Do you *want* to ruin my reputation?!\"\n\n  **Person in Sweats (dancing badly, arms flailing):** \"Relax, Your Highness. It’s called *having fun*! You’re the one who dragged me here, remember? Besides, my ‘disaster music’ is *objectively* superior. Now come on, show me your *fancy moves*—or don’t. Either way, I’m getting another soda. Want one? Or another lecture about my *lack of fashion sense*?\"\n\n---", "logprobs": [{"token": "*", "logprob": -0.12474125623703003}, {"token": " ---\n", "logprob": -3.3330252170562744}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -1.4067232608795166}, {"token": " **", "logprob": -0.23619797825813293}, {"token": "Lady", "logprob": -3.270232915878296}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -1.1712610721588135}, {"token": " Ball", "logprob": -0.12043549865484238}, {"token": " G", "logprob": -0.0025038341991603374}, {"token": "own", "logprob": -0.0007939761853776872}, {"token": " (", "logprob": -1.3940339088439941}, {"token": "ad", "logprob": -0.4096047878265381}, {"token": "just", "logprob": -0.0011239885352551937}, {"token": "ing", "logprob": -0.04866999387741089}, {"token": " her", "logprob": -0.45030224323272705}, {"token": " gloves", "logprob": -0.07026753574609756}, {"token": "):**", "logprob": -0.14643347263336182}, {"token": " \"", "logprob": -1.0522089004516602}, {"token": "Good", "logprob": -3.350740909576416}, {"token": " grief", "logprob": -4.171972751617432}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.02574363723397255}, {"token": " d", "logprob": -2.6275136470794678}, {"token": "arl", "logprob": -0.0002224197960458696}, {"token": "ing", "logprob": -0.0008998635457828641}, {"token": "—", "logprob": -1.8468939065933228}, {"token": "you", "logprob": -0.8645040392875671}, {"token": "’re", "logprob": -0.5873352885246277}, {"token": " actually", "logprob": -1.1933467388153076}, {"token": " going", "logprob": -2.1205427646636963}, {"token": " out", "logprob": -0.9035679697990417}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -1.0015549659729004}, {"token": " *", "logprob": -0.22578051686286926}, {"token": "those", "logprob": -0.17904922366142273}, {"token":